      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ndru nuti i ceng’ pa Daudi rundi adek, rundi ku rundi; e Daudi yenyo wang’ Yehova. Man Yehova wacu kumae, En e pi Saul, man kum ot pare mi rimo, kum eketho Jugibeoni tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.9.3+JOS.9.4+JOS.9.5+JOS.9.6+JOS.9.7+JOS.9.8+JOS.9.9+JOS.9.10+JOS.9.11+JOS.9.12+JOS.9.13+JOS.9.14+JOS.9.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 9:3-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo Lwong’o Jugibeoni, e ewacu igi (nwang’u Jugibeoni gi kind nyithindho mir Israel ungo, ento mi dong’ Juamori; man nyithindho mir Israel gikwong’o igi: man Saul uponjo negogi, kum ngiri pare ma pi nyithindho mir Israel ku Yuda); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e Daudi wacu ni Jugibeoni kumae, Abitimo ang’o iwu? man abiculo kud ang’o, kara wumi mugisa wi aba pa Yehova? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Jugibeoni giwacu ire kumae, En e lembe mi mola ma tar kadi mola ma kwar ungo ma ni i kindwa ku Saul, kadi ku ot pare; kadok en e iwa ngo ma nia waketh ng’atu moko tho i kind Israel. Man ewacu kumae, Gin ma wubiwacu, maeno abitimo iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwacu ni ubimo kumae, Ng’atu m’unyothowa, man m’upido lembe i kumwa, nia junyothwa ku wadong’ i kieu moko mir Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wek jumi iwa dhanu abiro ma kind wote, man wabilierogi malu ba Yehova i Gebeya pa Saul, ma ng’atu ma Yehova goyo wie. E ubimo wacu kumae, Abimiogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
