            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.20.15+1SA.20.16+1SA.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 20:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.1+2SA.9.2+2SA.9.3+2SA.9.4+2SA.9.5+2SA.9.6+2SA.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ubimo cero Mefiboceth, ma wod Yonathan ma wod Saul, ni kum kwong’ pa Yehova ma ni i kindgi, i kind Daudi ku Yonathan ma wod Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ubimo gamu wot ario pa Rizpa ma nyar Aia, m’enyolo ni Saul, gin Armoni man Mefiboceth; man wot Mikal abic ma nya Saul m’enyolo ni Adriel ma wod Barzilai ma Jameholathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man emiogi i cing’ Jugibeoni, e gilierogi wi got i wang’ Yehova, man gipodho gin abiro karacelo. Man junegogi i ceng’ mi mwoka, i ceng’ ma kwong’ane, ka jutheko mwokanganu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Rizpa ma nyar Aia gamu gonia, man epedhe ire wi cana, ugambre i thekri mi mwoka cil ma pi ukonjre i wigi kud i polo; man eyio ngo nia winyo m’i polo ubed i wigi ku dieceng’, kadi yedi m’i thim de ku diewor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E juyero pi gin ma Rizpa ma nyar Aia, ma dhaku m’araga pa Saul, utimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
